MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi,
Check your parameterisations.
The precision parameter for ar1 in inla is the marginal precision (called kappa in http://www.math.ntnu.no/inla/r-inla.org/doc/latent/ar1.pdf ), but your arima.sim() call specified the stad.dev <http://stad.dev>. of the AR process innovation terms.

Finn

